WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.000
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.630
Astragius Year 7214

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.750
Gilgamesh-Balarant Central Sector Forces

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.750
Joint Mission Treaty Ceremony

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:10.080
We must now accept what our
historians are telling us.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.630
The constant struggle between our two sides

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:15.750
was born on Quent 3,000 years ago
by these "Overmen" mutants

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.000
who declared themselves the Children of God.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.460
In short, the techniques of
PS development lost in the past

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:25.000
and the last 3,000 years of history
in the Astragius Galaxy

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.420
were, in reality, simply given to us by them.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.880
I don't want to believe it...

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.710
But it's the truth!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:38.250
Now we must join forces and
take the galaxy back from their control.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.040
First, we kill Chirico.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.250
Then we destroy that "Children of God"
society that captured him!

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.920
Let's get the treaty signing completed.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.130
And then form a mission council
as soon as possible.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.630
This looks like a historic day.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:59.500
It is. The last surviving god will finally die!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:05.580
Overman

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.460
Chirico, what did you and Wiseman talk about?

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:26.130
Go.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.380
He's summoning you.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.130
Hurry!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.830
Go.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.380
Chirico?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.420
We have to obey him?

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.710
But, why him?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.130
An Overman?

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:20.130
But he isn't a Quentian, like you!

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:24.250
Do you mean...? But Chirico's identical to us!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.290
Bastards!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.670
God dammit, they're everywhere!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.750
But we're close to Chirico!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.210
All right, then!

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:50.960
What's happening?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:52.830
Sir!

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.040
The Prototype and Chirico's friends have escaped!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.920
Idiots! And we can't find Rochina, either...

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.540
All right, get everyone out on this!
Defend the passageway!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.460
Hang on!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.880
Hey, those cables are burning! Put them out!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.210
What are you doing, Pops?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.580
My gut's stuck in here. Help me!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:54.000
What's the hold up? Breathe out, you idiot!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.500
How do we get in?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.420
I dunno! Wiseman decides!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.500
He chooses who gets to go in!

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.170
What's the hold up? They'll be here any second!

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.330
Chirico!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.750
Chirico, you're all right.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.880
Hey...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.540
What's wrong, Chirico?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.290
Chirico!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.460
Hey, Chirico, my man! You're looking good.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.790
You're, uh, floating in mid-air.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.500
How are you doing that?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.710
Uh, Coconna, does he look strange to you?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.420
Chirico, did Wiseman say something to you?

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.830
What did he do to you?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:42.920
Get out!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.920
What's going on?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.420
You haven't forgotten who we are, have you?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.330
We risked our lives coming here
because we were worried about you.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.960
C'mon, tell us what happened-

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.080
You will know soon. Return to your room.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.580
What's the big idea, talking to us like that?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.290
Since when are you the boss?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.500
Since a little while ago, actually.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.210
We're now Chirico's servants.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.420
You're what?

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.670
Surrender!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.000
That's it for us.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.080
Chirico! Please, tell me what's going on!

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:23.670
Take them back.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:24.830
Chirico!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.500
Chirico! Chirico!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.380
We leave in three hours.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.170
Take on all the weaponry and supplies you can.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:36.830
We're leaving?

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.750
Where are we going?

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.250
You don't need to think about the reasons.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.710
My orders are Wiseman's orders!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:46.790
Go!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.540
I still don't believe it.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.000
How can a non-Quentian be an Overman?

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.540
Overmen are simply a type of
mutation which occurs

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.710
when a civilization reaches a certain point.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.580
Perhaps we were bound to have
one born among us eventually.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.630
But, Chirico...?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.540
The Quentians feared
the appearance of the Overmen.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.710
Destroyed their civilization because of it.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.500
That's why Wiseman is so interested
in a fellow Overman like Chirico.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:37.710
But why do we have to follow his orders?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.580
Don't ask me!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.080
Something's going on.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.580
Gurran, if we just go along with this...

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:48.130
Enough already! I'm exhausted from
trying to decide what to believe!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.210
Haven't we been able to find Rochina yet?

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.790
We're still looking for him.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:54.880
Hurry!

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.000
I'd feel better if I could
discuss Chirico with Rochina.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.790
That face... He looked like the old Chirico.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.790
He was like that the first time I met him.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.250
I thought he was finally loosening up.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.710
I can't believe what talking to
Wiseman could do to him!

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.630
Looks like he's just a puppet now.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.830
That's not it at all.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.080
Nobody could control him.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:30.380
His face looked like he'd just accepted
the biggest responsibility in the world.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.210
Yes...

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.580
He definitely looked like he was
bent on doing something.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.130
But what is it?

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.500
Have you finished the program analysis?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.670
We're running it.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:51.000
But I think taking the ship through
those floating things is risky-

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.670
I don't want to hear your opinions!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.540
Y-yes, sir!

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.580
That navigation program was
prepared by Wiseman.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.540
It's not dangerous at all. Input it at once!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.630
Aye, sir!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.630
You seem busy, Chirico.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.460
Rochina... Haven't they caught you yet?

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:10.420
I had a rather wild and misspent youth.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.130
Turns out my old talents are coming in handy.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.130
Where are you?

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.960
Take your time in finding me.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.670
It was a lot of trouble to arrange this private talk.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.250
You've already told me the basic situation.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.580
I'm a bit surprised by it.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.130
I want you to tell me one thing, though.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.130
What?

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.710
Wiseman's will!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.290
What were his orders to you?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.790
I'm sorry.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:40.250
I know Wiseman's used you terribly,
but I can't tell you.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.460
Answer me!
Have you accepted his purpose for you?

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:44.670
Of course.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:47.960
I take it you'll benefit from it?

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:53.040
Yes, and the Gilgamesh and Balarant
have joined forces to stop me.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.040
What?

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:58.290
They're on their way here to kill me.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:01.170
They know about Wiseman's existence as well...

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.750
They'll destroy this place!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.460
We'll escape before then.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.540
Impossible!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.500
You think you can escape their
central star sector fleets?

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.290
Perhaps.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.580
Stop being unreasonable and surrender to me!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.250
I can guarantee your safety!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.330
What's that?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.960
Apparently, they're here.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.330
I can't talk anymore.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.960
Chirico, tell me! What's your objective?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.710
To meet Wiseman.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.170
I've been invited.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.920
It seems we go back a long way.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.540
Chirico! Chiri-

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.420
What's all the hubbub?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.880
And what're you gonna do with us?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.040
We're evacuating the base.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.290
The Gilgamesh and Balarant forces are coming.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.080
He's going to save us?

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.630
Thank you, Chirico!
He still has some feelings left.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.960
Right. He still owes us, remember?

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.750
Chirico, you're really going to use
the Floater Belt?

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.500
Isn't that dangerous?

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.750
Do you doubt Wiseman?

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.290
It's not that. It's just...

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:08.290
Why do you think Wiseman has the base
surrounded by those things?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.460
Their only purpose is to surround
and destroy attacking enemies.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:14.710
But there's a chance-

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:16.130
Supply loading status?

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:18.040
Sir! Just a few minutes more!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.290
Finish at once! The operation's starting.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:36.000
This is the Gilgamesh flagship!

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.630
All units, prepare for battle!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.960
This is the Balarant flagship.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.250
Encircle southern hemisphere.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.750
Enemy ships: 150.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.830
160 coming from the southern hemisphere.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.000
Distance: LL-5.

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.210
Now within their firing range!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.830
Begin operation!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.920
Enemy base segment moving off!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:28.710
Course: R-1314, L-1512.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.500
Entering asteroid belt.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.000
No, it's breaking through!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.580
Balarant B-24 forward forces:

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.630
Bear on asteroid belt interior.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:38.830
Emergency launch!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:54.790
It... It's impossible!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.290
The enemy's waiting for us
as soon as we clear the Floater Belt!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:58.880
We can't escape!

00:15:58.880 --> 00:15:59.710
We can.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:02.750
There's more than 500 ships!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:06.250
And far more Floaters!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.630
Prepare to launch!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.210
Reconfirm position!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.290
As soon as you can, move out!

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.170
Hey, where's Chirico?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.960
On the mothership bridge.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.540
Mothership? Isn't that this ship?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.830
No, this is the support module.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.540
We're connected right now,
but we'll separate for the operation.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:32.920
What?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:40.830
Launch!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.290
The enemy ship!

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.000
What?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.330
It's trying to lose us in the asteroid belt!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.540
It worked!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.830
They can't follow us without being cautious!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.960
Don't speak too soon.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:57.000
We can't stay in the belt forever.

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:45.210
Fires have broken out in fifty places on board!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.380
We're doomed!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:48.670
No, we've won.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:53.750
We're still accelerating.
In a moment we'll outrun them.

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.210
Attention all hands!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.460
In a few minutes,
our speed will exceed our enemies'.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:02.830
We will escape.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:06.250
However, this ship won't hold out that long.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.210
The support module will now separate.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.210
It will hold off the enemy
until the mothership escapes.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:20.210
Men, for Wiseman's sake,
you will lay down your lives!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.210
What?

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:23.080
Chirico!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.630
Understood, sir! It will be our honor!

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.250
Very well. Separate!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.580
Chirico!

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.170
You're just leaving us to die?

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.500
And, finally, I will tell you now
why your deaths won't be in vain.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.500
I now go to Wiseman.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.420
To where the galaxy has been
ruled for 3,000 years.

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.580
He's what?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.380
He has chosen me, one born as a PS-

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.080
No, as an Overman, to be his successor.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:11.040
He awaits me, buried beneath
the surface of Quent.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:12.580
Yes.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:18.960
3,000 years ago, the Quentians believed they'd
driven the Children of God from their world.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:23.380
But Wiseman was always hidden on Quent.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.040
What?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.750
I don't believe it.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.380
Is that true, Chirico?

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:31.250
And now I go to Quent, to be the new ruler!

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:42.670
Stand back, everyone!

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:48.750
Move it!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.630
Pops! Hurry!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.460
We're outta here!

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.880
Chirico, are you really...?

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:26.830
I had been born a PS.

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:30.830
Destined to an existence
beyond that of mere men.

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:35.000
Whether that's true or not isn't the question.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:38.540
Wiseman had decided it was.

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:43.500
I had only to accept the destiny assigned to me.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:50.380
To be the chosen successor
to the rule of the Astragius Galaxy.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:59.330
The one man in the galaxy who can do it...

00:22:59.330 --> 00:23:02.000
now decides on his destination
and begins his dash for it.

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:04.580
The man born as a PS.

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:07.250
The Overman. The Child of God.

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:09.710
Absolute ruler of the Balarant. The Gilgamesh.

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:11.790
Of all Astragius.

00:23:12.380 --> 00:23:15.710
A heroic decision accelerates him towards it.

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:17.710
Towards holding all creation in his hands.

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.290
Next time, "Storm Clouds"

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:24.290
Storm Clouds

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:22.630
No one can stop him now.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.830
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
